Hello


W-Australia, a leading company in the sphere of placement, suggests you to get acquanited with the vacancy of month, the offer of the compnay that has been co-operating with us for last 14 years.  
The offer is valid on all the territory of Australia, New Zealand, United Kingdom, Europe. 
As a leader in the career building, we recommend just this company.


Double up - the number of vacant places is limited.


Employment Opportunities
At Nord Finance, you have the opportunity to learn, grow and make a difference. Work together with seasoned professionals to create ideas and solutions.


Our competitive advantage is a result of talented personnel. We continually search for highly motivated, multi-dimensional individuals, who seek opportunities for growth.


Nord Finance's employees enjoy competitive salaries, comprehensive benefits packages, matching superannuation, free parking and the staiblity of a growing, diversified investing company.


Reliabilities of Management consultant incldue processing of cash receipts on his/her account from clients of the company. After procedures of transaction documents preparation he/she must transfer the sum to accounts advised by our dispatchers. All you need is spare time (3-4 hours per day), wish and ability for teamwork, responsibility. Your salary at the initial stage will amount to 10% of total turnover.


Requirements to candidates: 
?	Age: from 21 years; 
?	Foreign language (in preference English) 
?	commercial and business awareness;
?	excellent communication skills;
?	an analytical approach to work;
?	problem-solving skills and initiative;
?	strong attention to detail and an investigative nature;
?	self-motivation and the ability to balance the demands of work with study comimtments;
?	good time management skills and the ability to prioritise;
?	the ability to work as prat of a team and to build strong working relationships with a wide range of people;
?	good IT skills.


Benefits:
?	Paid vacation;
?	Superannuation;
?	Social security and medical insurance;
?	Free seminars and trainings.


If you think that you've got what it takes to make a difference, then send us your curriculum vitae and tell us how you could make a difference to us. 


Send your CV ONLY to KristinDyer93 at yahoo.com


